State-Update Algorithm (Follow Exactly)
For every action in the history, do the following steps in order:
Parse the action type (e.g., LOAD, UNLOAD, DRIVE, etc.). You only care about DRIVE actions. Ignore all non-DRIVE actions for state updates.
Maintain the location of each truck:
